    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch06-02: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.69";
    dc:description "Existing catalogs make the taxonomy testable for broad bounded samples, but class assignment requires interpretation and can vary with initial condition and run length. The universal scope cannot be exhaustively covered.";
