    dc:type "resolution-route/computation";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Create blinded classifications of long runs from random initial conditions using explicit metrics for convergence, periodicity, entropy, and localized structures. Measure agreement and the fraction of sampled rules that fit exactly one of four classes.";
